config MI_HARDWARE_ID
	tristate "Xiaomi board identification"
	help
	  Answers which board this is and which region it was sold in, from
	  what the bootloader puts on the kernel command line.  The Xiaomi
	  drivers use it to adjust for hardware revision.

	  Say M here to build it as a module, hwid.ko.  If unsure, say N.
